extends ../layouts/layout.pug

block title
  | Technology and grace net

block content
  .technology
    .technology__blockquote
      .container
        .technology__blockquote-logo.mobile
          img(src=require('@/assets/img/svg/logo-3d.svg') alt="logo")
        blockquote
          cite Overview
          p We believe that people’s future relies on decentralised applications. The mission of GRACE is to support the rapid growth of the blockchain industry by offering a fastest, secure, and efficient data transmission solution.
        .technology__blockquote-title CORE FEATURES
    .technology__features
      .container
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | SECURITY AND PROTECTION
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              ul
                li Establishing connection between authenticated participants only
                li Preventing unauthorized access and potential data breaches
                li Lack of sensitivity to L3, L4 types of attacks
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | PREMIUM QUALITY CONNECTIVITY
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              ul
                li Allocates a given transfer rate
                li Support for the quality of traffic transfer with arbitrary latencies and losses
                li Lack of interference between traffics
                li New Data Packaging Method
                li Improved accuracy
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | SPEED AND RESPONSIVENESS
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              ul
                li Significant improvements in data transmission speeds
                li Low latency and reliability improvements of timestamps used for consensus
                li Precise mathematical model and data transmission algorithms optimization
                li Consistent timestamp synchronization across blockchain networks
                li New Operational Mode
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | DETERMINACY OF DATA TRANSFER
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              ul
                li Target packet transfer rate
                li Network Delay Insensitivity
                li Ideal for real-time applications
              p The arrival time of each data packet is predefined, ensuring timely delivery. Grace Net ensures that all data packets guaranteed and reach their destination without loss or delay. Maintains a consistent order of data packets, preserving the sequence in which they were sent.
    .technology__features.noisy-bg
      .container
        .technology__features-header
          .technology__features-header-title
            span Build Better with
            br
            | Better Grace Net
          .separate-line.separate-line--vertical
          .technology__features-header-text
            p Aims to unlock new possibilities for decentralized applications and platforms, revolutionizing blockchain connectivity and&nbsp;drive the next wave of digital evolution.
        .separate-line
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | What Is GRACE NET used for
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              p Using Grace Net capabilities will allow to handle large volumes of traffic without interference while each blockchain on the network will operate independently, maintaining its own unique features and governance. Grace Net protocol allows blockchains and dApps to scale efficiently, facilitating load balancing and efficient resource allocation.
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | What Decentralized Architecture
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              p An ease of integration, making it accessible to a wide range of blockchain applications and platforms. Minimizes single points of failure, boosting resilience in blockchain networks. Grace Net distributes timestamp synchronization among multiple nodes, ensuring uninterrupted operation and reliability amid disruptions or compromises.
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | What Finance, Payments and Cross-Chain Asset Swaps
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              p In scenarios where timing and transaction order are crucial, ensuring swift and accurate processing of financial transactions and smart contracts is essential. This enhances overall market efficiency and fairness for all participants.
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | What Smart Contracts and Decentralized Applications (DApps)
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              p Grace Net is foundational for seamless operation in decentralized applications (dApps). With swift and reliable data transmission, it boosts smart contract efficiency for automated transactions within dApps. Vital for sectors like finance, gaming, and supply chain with real-time data needs.
        .accordion
          .accordion__head
            | What Governance Platforms
            .accordion__head-btn
          .accordion__content
            .accordion__content-wrap
              p dApps empower decentralized governance and decision-making, ensuring compatibility across different blockchains. Grace Net technology facilitates transparent governance mechanisms spanning multiple chains, enabling stakeholders to vote, delegate, and propose changes. This fosters community-driven governance and decentralized decision-making.
        a(href="#").button White Paper
